# Styling

- Use Tailwind CSS.
- Mobile-first approach.
- Avoid new CSS files unless necessary.
- Use twMerge for dynamic classes.

Preferred:

- flex
- grid
- gap
- max-w
- mx-auto
- min-h-screen


Class order:

Layout
Display
Flex/Grid
Spacing
Sizing
Typography
Background
Border
Effects
Animation


# Accessibility

Always include:

- alt text for images
- aria-label where required
- button type
- semantic HTML